# N10: the start map's entrance hall, slop, no status bar, a slow linear dolly ("Claude,
# Anthropic's model, wrote the code"). The edit dims it under its diagram.

map start

duration 13.6
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 0     544,272.31,54  0,90  ease linear
key 13.6  544,485.69,54  0,90

sound on
events on
